{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年35歲、素有「最美千金」美譽的已故賭王三房千金何超蓮，自2023年與內地男星竇驍在峇里島舉行世紀婚禮後，雖已升呢人妻，但並未選擇養尊處優做少奶奶。</p><p>近年她依舊事業心極重，除了頻頻在社交平台分享生活與工作日常，更積極參演電影及出席各大時尚品</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.631679+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.373128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:21.373128+00:00","content_hash":"f3669dfa325e206cfbe6bc4384fd46d30a6dbb1fe48a6414b7189671fe3dcecb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}